  "content": {
   "rendered": "<p>It was a cold March morning when Gus finally rose.</p><figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://fernhill.example/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/first-loaf-1024x768.jpg\" srcset=\"https://fernhill.example/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/first-loaf-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://fernhill.example/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/first-loaf-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https://fernhill.example/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/first-loaf-300x225.jpg 300w\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" alt=\"The first loaf\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"/></figure><p>We sold out by nine.</p><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What we learned</h2><ol><li>Patience</li><li>More patience</li></ol>"
  },
